  "note": "The four old members for Harryville Ward were returned unopposed and declared elected by the town clerk and returning officer (Ballymena Observer, 13 May 1955, p. 8). The report prints Morrow's surname only; John Morrow sat for the ward in 1949, 1952 and 1958. Returned unopposed. Uncertain: Morrow's forename is not printed."
